 Forget this folder's choice?                                            in C:\Projects\quiz-slayer

 C:\Projects will no longer have its own Claude Code rule. It and every folder inside it will use
 default (you@personal.example), like everywhere else.

 Devpit will write:
   ~/AppData/Roaming/devpit/accounts.toml (changes)
     [[rule]]
     folder = 'C:\Projects'
     github = "work"

